<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00420">
	<title>Starting the vehicle with smart key</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>EV button 
					<indexterm>starting the vehicle with smart key</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01717">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01718">
								<figgroup>
									<image align="center" href="../../images/N_CT25D013_E.eps" scale="95" placement="break"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>The vehicle will check for the smart key when:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p>The vehicle doors are opened</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>The <term translate="no">EV</term> button is pressed</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>If the smart key is not in the vehicle, the indicator (<image align="left" href="../../images/WKIA_044.eps" scale="15" placement="inline"/>) and the message will appear on the instrument cluster.</p>
	</conbody>
</concept>